// (style edm, seed 1): intro → build → drop → verse → breakdown → build II → final drop → outro.
// Themes: A — Afterglow (минорный гимн) (recomposed), B — Skyline (фестивальный хук) (recomposed); the bridge melody is newly
// composed on the rhythm of a theme from kawaii. Computed parts: a counter-melody from the chords, a run up to the dominant in every build-up, the theme at half speed in the outro, a key change up.
// It is an ordinary song file: change anything; the melodies can be drawn in the piano roll (P).
// x is time in beats; n counts semitones from C4 (MIDI 60).
